WEBVTT

00:10:27.634 --> 00:10:30.804
You are a hands-on innovator,

00:10:30.804 --> 00:10:33.474
but now, because of this managerial bit

00:10:33.474 --> 00:10:35.804
and the strategic bit that comes with it,

00:10:35.804 --> 00:10:39.304
is that more where you are in tune,

00:10:39.304 --> 00:10:42.384
is that more fun 
than being a hands-on innovator

00:10:42.384 --> 00:10:44.034
as you started off as?

00:10:45.284 --> 00:10:49.054
SP: There is a lot of demand to spend
most of my time on management,

00:10:49.054 --> 00:10:50.924
I tend to travel a lot.

00:10:50.924 --> 00:10:52.814
But still at the end of the day,

00:10:52.814 --> 00:10:55.304
the thing I love the most
is building products.

00:10:55.304 --> 00:10:59.894
So I do try and carve out enough time
and spend time every week

00:10:59.894 --> 00:11:01.824
with my engineers